1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 16=

19
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:56,200
Let those demons
live their lives inside.

20
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:59,040
Cast the spell with me

21
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,159
and seal the entrance.

22
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:02,159
- Yes.
- Yes.

23
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,400
Fahai.

24
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,400
Master.

25
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,680
How am I supposed
to cast the spell like this?

26
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:29,000
It's fine, Master. Just go ahead.

27
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
I won't bother you.

28
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,960
Are you worried I'll get pulled in?

29
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,960
Yes.

30
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Mr. Gu.

31
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,080
Mrs. Fang, you're here.

32
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,080
Please, come on in.

33
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:02,960
Is the outfit I ordered ready?

34
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:06,240
You mean the one for Captain Fang?

35
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,520
Of course, the one for my husband.

36
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,000
It's been ready for a while.

37
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:14,280
Truth be told,
the size should be just right.

38
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:25,039
I'll go get it for you now.

39
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,039
Aunt,

40
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,439
that man seems a little off.

41
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,599
Not at all.

42
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,840
You're so beautiful.

43
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,560
It's only natural
that people's eyes linger.

44
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,400
Aunt,

45
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,360
you look like you've recovered well
these past few days.

46
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,840
I was never seriously hurt.

47
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:48,080
What about you?
Were you frightened that day?

48
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,719
Of course not.

49
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,840
I was actually more worried
about Xu Xian.

50
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,840
Xu Xian? What happened to him?

51
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,039
Is he distancing himself from you again?

52
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,319
It must be because of
what happened last time.

53
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,360
He fears involving you once more.

54
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,360
Aunt, I'm not afraid of being involved.

55
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,439
I'm just afraid

56
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,600
what I have with Young Master Xu

57
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,600
is not yet a proper,

58
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,720
recognized bond.

59
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,839
Don't worry, I'll speak up for you.

60
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:42,240
It's all my fault.
I put you all through that.

61
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,079
Wenhui, don't say that.

62
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:48,000
That is mainly my fault.

63
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,240
I didn't keep Aunt safe.

64
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,079
Let me toast you all.

65
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,199
No need to be so formal.

66
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:54,720
We're all family from now on.

67
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,759
So no more apologies for that.

68
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,240
Your aunt is right.

69
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:03,560
If you hadn't rescued your aunt,

70
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,240
the two of us probably...

71
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:08,519
Forget it.

72
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:12,439
First of all, I have to praise Xu Xian.

73
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,240
It was you who rescued your aunt.

74
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:19,560
Of course, I also want
to thank everyone else.

75
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:23,120
Thank you for venturing
into the lion's den with Xu Xian.

76
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:27,360
Here, Wenhui and I
raise a toast to you all.

77
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,519
Cheers.

78
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:29,519
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

79
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,920
Cheers.

80
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,120
Alright.

81
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:45,160
It's a happy day. Let's eat up.

82
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,160
To show my sincerity,

83
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,879
I'll down three cups in a row.

84
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,800
Fang.

85
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,519
This wine is hitting me pretty fast.

86
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:30,040
I'll do three cups too.

87
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,040
Three for me.

88
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,639
It's good.

89
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:02,759
Is it good?

90
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,000
Absolutely good.

91
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:14,199
Aunt,

92
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,639
well...

93
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:22,399
Xu Xian, you're at that age now.

94
00:07:22,959 --> 00:07:24,040
It's time you settled down.

95
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,920
Suzhen is gentle and gracious,

96
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:27,639
more than you deserve.

97
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:32,120
I can see the affection between you two.

98
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,040
Why don't we settle your marriage

99
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,879
right here, right now?

100
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:41,079
A-Aunt, I'm not ready yet.

101
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:43,639
Ready for what, exactly?

102
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,800
Your aunt has got it all ready for you.

103
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,759
There's no time like the present.

104
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,759
You know?

105
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,560
Uncle, weren't you just...

106
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,279
Suzhen, you...

107
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:01,279
I'm willing.

108
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,519
I have no objections.

109
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,279
Congratulations.

110
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:17,199
Since no one has any objections,

111
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,759
it's settled then.

112
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,600
Suzhen,

113
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,279
your parents are gone.

114
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:30,160
So I took the liberty

115
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:33,320
of preparing a few boxes of jewelry
as your dowry.

116
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,639
I hope you'll like them.

117
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:38,039
Yes. Of course I do.

118
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,519
I want to see them now.

119
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,240
Come on, I will show you.

120
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,279
Master Fang has drunk quite a lot today.

121
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,320
I'll get him to his room.

122
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,960
Come on, Master Fang.

123
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,120
Time to go back to your room.

124
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,360
No more eating. Let's go to your room.

125
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,360
No more eating.

126
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,360
Not eating another thing.

127
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,039
- Just go back.
- Let's go back.

128
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,480
I was wondering why Miss Bai

129
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,320
kept going on about how good
Aunt's cooking was tonight.

130
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,720
So she was just buttering her up.

131
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,840
My dear Young Master Xu,

132
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,759
you're about to get married.

133
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:27,279
What gift should I prepare for you?

134
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:29,039
I haven't agreed to it.

135
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,879
What do you mean?

136
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:35,639
I saw you holding
Suzhen's hand the other day.

137
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:40,279
What, are you trying
to toy with her feelings?

138
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,039
Of course not.

139
00:09:42,919 --> 00:09:44,440
I never would've guessed, Xu Xian.

140
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:48,000
You always act
like such an upright gentleman,

141
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:50,679
but behind our back,
you were holding her hand.

142
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,960
Anything else you shouldn't have?

143
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:55,960
I just want to be responsible
for Miss Bai.

144
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,000
So you have done it?

145
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
No.

146
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,639
I haven't avenged my parents yet.

147
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,440
And Changming seemed to be after me.

148
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:06,159
I don't want Miss Bai involved.

149
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,039
Suzhen isn't afraid of that.

150
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:15,799
What do you mean?

151
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:19,120
I mean, Fahai told me

152
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:22,840
that the Abbot of Jinshan Temple
has sent people to look into Changming.

153
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:24,759
You needn't worry too much.

154
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:28,080
Exactly, my master
has sent people to investigate.

155
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,559
Don't worry about that.

156
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:32,679
Your top priority now
is to care for Miss Bai,

157
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,200
marry her as soon as possible,

158
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,200
and ease her mind.

159
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,600
I can see the affection between you two.

160
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,559
Why don't we settle your marriage

161
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:47,120
right here, right now?

162
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:48,600
Suzhen, you...

163
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,600
I'm willing.

164
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,080
What I mean is, I'm fond of you.

165
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:01,279
A person like me
doesn't deserve a happy match.

166
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,159
Why not?

167
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:05,279
I curse you

168
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:07,879
to lose your true love forever!

169
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
I don't want you involved.

170
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,720
Miss Bai,

171
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:25,399
the matter with Changming
is not yet settled.

172
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,039
I have no mind
for other things right now.

173
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,960
But Changming is already dead.

174
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,279
Changming was full of tricks.

175
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:36,159
I fear someone else is behind him.

176
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:39,759
Don't be afraid.

177
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:43,080
The Abbot of Jinshan Temple
has sent people to investigate.

178
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:45,320
People from Jinshan Temple went too?

179
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:55,799
Don't worry.
I will definitely protect you.

180
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,799
With you here, I'm absolutely at ease.

181
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:56,879
Did you twist your ankle?

182
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,200
Can you still walk?

183
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,080
I can't walk anymore.

184
00:13:14,559 --> 00:13:15,559
Young Master Xu,

185
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,960
can you carry me?

186
00:14:10,879 --> 00:14:13,799
Can we move forward
as the Goddess instructed?

187
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:18,639
Yes, so how do we move forward?

188
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,559
According to mortal customs,

189
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,799
it's marriage, of course.

190
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:24,279
Once you two are united

191
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,879
and pass the love trial,

192
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,440
you can ascend to immortality.

193
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:44,000
Xu Xian, you mustn't
believe what outsiders say.

194
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,840
Your aunt didn't want a child of her own

195
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,879
not just because of you.

196
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:50,720
It was a decision I made with your aunt.

197
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,080
It was our choice.

198
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,759
Your aunt

199
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:58,000
poured all her motherly love

200
00:14:59,039 --> 00:15:00,639
into you.

201
00:15:02,159 --> 00:15:04,279
Father! Father!

202
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,159
Father!

203
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:11,159
Mother! Mother!

204
00:15:31,519 --> 00:15:32,519
Who is there?

205
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:55,000
M-Miss Bai?

206
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:18,320
M-Miss Bai,
I haven't finished bathing yet.

207
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,480
Could you please leave first?

208
00:16:53,103 --> 00:16:57,262
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

209
00:16:59,729 --> 00:17:04,107
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

210
00:17:05,650 --> 00:17:11,475
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

211
00:17:12,244 --> 00:17:16,711
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

212
00:17:19,576 --> 00:17:24,017
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

213
00:17:26,213 --> 00:17:30,943
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

214
00:17:32,155 --> 00:17:38,268
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

215
00:17:38,931 --> 00:17:44,713
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

216
00:17:44,713 --> 00:17:50,976
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

217
00:17:51,286 --> 00:17:57,645
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

218
00:17:57,816 --> 00:18:05,183
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

219
00:18:05,468 --> 00:18:11,015
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

220
00:18:11,506 --> 00:18:17,716
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

221
00:18:18,026 --> 00:18:24,799
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

222
00:18:25,796 --> 00:18:31,449
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

223
00:18:32,283 --> 00:18:36,691
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

224
00:18:37,456 --> 00:18:40,044
♪Having ever loved♪
